    "description": "The Favorite Pets Retrieval API empowers users to access and manage their list of favorite pets within the pet adoption platform. This endpoint allows consumers, such as pet adopters and shelters, to efficiently retrieve their selected favorite pets, enabling a smoother adoption experience. The API serves as a crucial resource for enhancing pet visibility and aiding decision-making in the adoption process. By providing quick access to favorite pets, it fosters a user-friendly interaction between potential adopters and available pets.",
